---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'

const updated = 'August 9, 2026'
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | MM2Shark"
  description="Terms of Service for MM2Shark.com — rules for using the MM2 value list and trade calculator."
>
  <article class="legal">
    <header class="legal-head">
      <p class="legal-kicker">Legal</p>
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p>Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        These Terms of Service (“Terms”) govern your use of MM2Shark.com. By using the site, you
        agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the site.
      </p>

      <h2>1. What MM2Shark is</h2>
      <p>
        MM2Shark provides community-oriented Murder Mystery 2 value information and trade tools for
        entertainment and reference. It is a fan-made project and is not an official Roblox or
        Nikilis service.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Not official values</h2>
      <p>
        Item values, demand scores, and calculator results are estimates based on community trading
        references. They are not guarantees of in-game worth, completed trade prices, or future
        market moves. You are solely responsible for trades you make.
      </p>

      <h2>3. No affiliation</h2>
      <p>
        Roblox®, Murder Mystery 2, and related names/assets are trademarks or property of their
        respective owners. MM2Shark.com is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Roblox
        Corporation or Nikilis.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>You agree not to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Abuse, overload, scrape aggressively, or disrupt the site or its infrastructure</li>
        <li>Attempt unauthorized access to systems or data</li>
        <li>Use the site for fraud, scams, or misleading trade schemes</li>
        <li>Misrepresent MM2Shark values as official Roblox or Nikilis prices</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        Site design, branding (including MM2Shark), and original content belong to MM2Shark or its
        licensors. Game item names and imagery remain the property of their owners and are used for
        identification / fan reference only.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        The site is provided “as is” without warranties of any kind, express or implied, including
        accuracy, availability, or fitness for a particular purpose. Trading involves risk of loss
        of in-game items.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent allowed by law, MM2Shark and its operators are not liable for any
        indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or for any loss of
        items, data, or profits arising from your use of the site or reliance on listed values.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        Discord and other linked services have their own terms. We are not responsible for those
        services.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may change the site or these Terms at any time. Continued use after changes means you
        accept the updated Terms. The “Last updated” date will be revised when Terms change.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these Terms:
        <a href="mailto:contact@mm2shark.com">contact@mm2shark.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
